    </div>
    <div class="tv-note" style="margin:0.75rem 0;font-size:0.85rem;color:#9a9082;line-height:1.4;">
      This is the complete program &mdash; module declaration, import, function, main, and I/O. Token boundaries are measured using toke's purpose-built BPE tokenizer (16,384 tokens, trained on 25,953 toke programs). Patterns like <code style="background:#2a2317;border:1px solid #2a2317;border-radius:3px;padding:0.1em 0.3em;font-size:0.82em;color:#f0c04a;">;i=io:std.io</code> (entire import as 1 token) and <code style="background:#2a2317;border:1px solid #2a2317;border-radius:3px;padding:0.1em 0.3em;font-size:0.82em;color:#f0c04a;">(n:i64):i64{if(n</code> (signature + conditional in 1 token) emerge naturally from BPE training on real toke code. <a href="/tokenizer" style="color:#f0c04a;">Try the live tokenizer &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>

