<div class="ms" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="ms-bench">
    <h4>What each stage is measured against</h4>
    <p>Six benchmarks (131.50, 131.51, 131.52, 131.55, 131.56, 128.15) cover multi-lane token counting, byte-level durability, constrained-decoding mask cost, cost per solved task, agentic token decomposition, and one pre-registered scorecard applied at every stage. They are being built before the training compute is spent.</p>
    <p class="veto"><strong>The veto:</strong> No lane advances without beating the no-training baseline &mdash; a frontier model with the syntax card and the grammar artefacts, and no training at all.</p>
