<div class="section-alt" style="background:#1f1a11;padding:3rem 2rem;margin:2rem 0;">
  <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;">
    <h2 style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Try the Model &mdash; Free API Access</h2>
    <p style="text-align:center;color:#9a9082;margin-bottom:2rem;font-size:0.9rem;">A fine-tuned 7B model that writes toke programs compiling correctly 100% of the time. Free tier &mdash; no credit card, no setup.</p>

    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2rem;margin-bottom:2rem;">
      <div style="background:#1f1a11;border:1px solid #2a2317;border-radius:8px;padding:1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:0.8rem;color:#f0c04a;">Developer Console</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#9a9082;margin-bottom:0.8rem;">Create a free account, get an API key, and start generating toke code. The console includes a playground to test prompts, API key management, and usage tracking with token counts.</p>
        <ul style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#9a9082;margin:0 0 1rem 1.2rem;line-height:1.8;">
          <li>Free tier: 1,000 tokens per 6 hours</li>
          <li>Request higher limits at no charge</li>
          <li>Opt in or out of data collection per key</li>
          <li>Track usage: tokens in, tokens out, toke BPE</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="https://console.tokelang.dev/signup" style="background:#2a2317;border:1px solid #f0c04a;color:#f0c04a;padding:0.5rem 1rem;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;">Create Free Account &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div style="background:#1f1a11;border:1px solid #2a2317;border-radius:8px;padding:1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:0.8rem;">API &amp; MCP</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#9a9082;margin-bottom:0.8rem;">Use the REST API directly or connect via MCP (Model Context Protocol) from Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, or any MCP-compatible client.</p>
        <pre style="background:#1f1a11;padding:0.8rem;border-radius:4px;font-size:0.75rem;overflow-x:auto;color:#6fc2b2;margin-bottom:1rem;">curl -X POST api.tokelang.dev/v1/generate \
  -H "X-Api-Key: YOUR_KEY" \
  -d '{"description": "Sum an array"}'

{"source": "m=sum;f=sum(arr:@i64)...",
 "tokens_in": 159,
 "tokens_out": 28,
 "toke_bpe_out": 13}</pre>
        <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#9a9082;">The response includes three token counts: model input and model output under the Qwen tokenizer, and the same output re-measured under toke's v0.3 purpose-built BPE. The third number is a <em>tokenizer-vs-tokenizer</em> reading of one text, not a reduction against any other language, and the v0.3 tokenizer it uses is lossy. It is reported so callers can see the lane, not as an efficiency claim.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="background:#1f1a11;border:1px solid #2a2317;border-radius:8px;padding:1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:0.8rem;">Model on HuggingFace</h3>
      <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#9a9082;margin-bottom:0.8rem;">The Gate 2 model (2026-05-22) is published on HuggingFace. Download it, run locally, or fine-tune for your own use case. Includes model card, tokenizer, and training details. It was trained on the <strong>v0.3</strong> corpus and predates the breaking v0.4 syntax change; no v0.4-native model has been trained yet. See the <a href="/roadmap" style="color:#f0c04a;">roadmap</a>.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:center;">
        <a href="https://huggingface.co/karwalski/toke" style="background:#2a2317;border:1px solid #6b6356;color:#9a9082;padding:0.5rem 1rem;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.85rem;">View on HuggingFace &rarr;</a>
        <span style="color:#6b6356;font-size:0.8rem;">Qwen 2.5 Coder 7B + QLoRA &middot; Apache 2.0 &middot; v0.3 syntax &middot; 100% compile Pass@1 / 55.6% functional on the curated Gate-2 set (272/489)</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align:center;">
      <a href="https://console.tokelang.dev" style="color:#f0c04a;font-size:0.85rem;">console.tokelang.dev</a>
      <span style="color:#6b6356;margin:0 0.5rem;">&middot;</span>
      <a href="https://huggingface.co/karwalski/toke" style="color:#9a9082;font-size:0.85rem;">HuggingFace</a>
      <span style="color:#6b6356;margin:0 0.5rem;">&middot;</span>
      <a href="https://github.com/karwalski/toke-mcp" style="color:#9a9082;font-size:0.85rem;">MCP Server</a>
      <span style="color:#6b6356;margin:0 0.5rem;">&middot;</span>
      <a href="https://ollama.com/karwalski/toke" style="color:#9a9082;font-size:0.85rem;">Ollama</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

